      "data": {
        "text": "Reference-image → ad video + voiceover\n\n1. Drop 1-3 reference images into the Request Inputs slots on the left.\n2. The top Gemini writes a 15s video-direction prompt; the bottom Gemini writes a 15s voiceover script.\n3. Generate Video runs Veo 3.1 (8s) and Extend Video continues it to ~16s.\n4. Generate Audio reads the voiceover script with the chosen voice.\n5. Add Audio to Video muxes them; the merge stops at the shorter input (`-shortest`) so the final clip is ~15s with synced narration."
      }
